{"unit_id":"Kyenix__dsh-boot-animation#card-zh","repo":"Kyenix/dsh-boot-animation","commit":"c5f304355542fa2d9a98a6c73d0cf69ed097da92","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-boot-animation 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的启动动画插件：它在应用界面加载前显示视频，并在启动完成后交接到 DSH。插件通过本机 Web 服务器提供视频清单和媒体字节，再把启动屏脚本注入页面 head；素材按文件名顺序播放，可显示启动进度并支持提前进入。设置卡片可开关动画、调整淡入时长、选择片尾淡出、播完淡出或点击进入，并管理素材池、查看视频时长与播放提示。适合希望自定义 DSH 网页启动体验的人。需要安装在本地 DSH profile 中，并提供 @deepseek-ai/schemastery 以显示设置卡片；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:440-528","src/boot-screen.js:300-336","src/client.js:483-589"]}
{"unit_id":"Kyenix__dsh-boot-animation#card-en","repo":"Kyenix/dsh-boot-animation","commit":"c5f304355542fa2d9a98a6c73d0cf69ed097da92","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-boot-animation adds a video intro to the DSH web client, playing local clips in order and showing startup progress. It fades when the app is ready. A settings card controls the fade, clips, and switch. Settings require @deepseek-ai/schemastery. No API key or external service is used.","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:440-528","src/boot-screen.js:300-336","src/client.js:483-589"]}
